    seo_title: "How to Choose a Reliable Appliance Repair Service",
    seo_description: "What separates a good appliance repair company from a bad one: licensing, diagnostic fees, parts policy, warranty terms and the questions worth asking.",
    focus_keyword: "appliance repair service",
    social_image: "/images/blog/how-to-choose-a-reliable-appliance-repair-service.svg",
