    metadata: {"search_intent":"Informational","target_audience":"Homeowners whose air conditioner runs but does not cool the house, looking for checks to try before booking a technician.","article_length":"974 words","cta_target":"See HVAC service options","internal_links":"/blog/furnace-maintenance-checklist\n/blog/when-should-you-hire-a-licensed-electrician\n/blog/how-to-compare-home-service-estimates","visual_direction":"Flat vector medallion: a wall air conditioning unit with a sun chip, a gauge chip and a check chip on a cream background."},
    related: [{"slug":"furnace-maintenance-checklist","title":"A Yearly Furnace Maintenance Checklist","excerpt":"Most winter heating failures are predictable: a filter nobody changed, a flame sensor nobody cleaned, a vent nobody inspected. This checklist covers what to do monthly, yearly and never.","featured_image":"/images/blog/furnace-maintenance-checklist.svg","featured_image_alt":"Illustration of a home furnace with a calendar and a safety shield","published_at":"isoDaysAgo(4, 9)","category":{"slug":"hvac","name":"HVAC"}},{"slug":"common-appliance-problems-when-to-call-a-repair-professional","title":"Common Appliance Problems and When to Call a Repair Professional","excerpt":"Most appliance failures announce themselves before they stop working. Here are the symptoms worth acting on, the checks that are safe to do yourself, and the point where a technician should take over.","featured_image":"/images/blog/common-appliance-problems-when-to-call-a-repair-professional.svg","featured_image_alt":"Illustration of a technician checking the inside of a wall oven while a homeowner looks on","published_at":"isoDaysAgo(13, 9)","category":{"slug":"appliance-repair","name":"Appliance Repair"}},{"slug":"refrigerator-not-cooling-common-causes","title":"Refrigerator Not Cooling? Common Causes Homeowners Should Know","excerpt":"A refrigerator that runs but will not cool is usually one of eight things. Start with the checks that cost nothing, then decide whether the sealed system needs a professional.","featured_image":"/images/blog/refrigerator-not-cooling-common-causes.svg","featured_image_alt":"Illustration of an open refrigerator with warm air indicated, a thermometer and a technician's tool bag","published_at":"isoDaysAgo(12, 9)","category":{"slug":"appliance-repair","name":"Appliance Repair"}}],
